      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Boykin,_Alabama"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "After emancipation, former slaves in Gee's Bend stayed as sharecroppers, often trapped in debt due to inflated plantation commissary prices.",
