        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Boykin,_Alabama"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In the 1960s, Gee's Bend joined the Freedom Quilting Bee, selling handmade quilts to support families during the Civil Rights Movement.",
